sec 7.4/8.2: the root's far succession, carried first and only by its VOID record at 5, retires it and admits K2; its succession to K3, carried by K2 at 10, admits nobody but is a ledger entry, so the walk puts K3 in office: K3's entry is EXCLUDED and CARRIED_MALFORMED as FOREIGN, K2's entry a certain AUTHORITY_MISMATCH; BROKEN_CHAIN.
